    "Gold, stocks, crypto or foreign currency, at the price you know.": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ຄຳ, ຮຸ້ນ, ຄຣິບໂຕ ຫຼື ເງິນຕາຕ່າງປະເທດ ຕາມລາຄາທີ່ເຈົ້າຮູ້"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ทอง หุ้น คริปโต หรือเงินตราต่างประเทศ ตามราคาที่คุณรู้"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vàng, cổ phiếu, crypto hay ngoại tệ, theo giá bạn biết."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Money lent": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ເງິນທີ່ໃຫ້ຢືມ"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เงินที่ให้ยืม"
